    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79822" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παροψ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽὄψον̓</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρόψημα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				147
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				187
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.3.4
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κακῶν παροψίδες</span>
			<i>fresh tastes</i> of misery, <i><span class="en">
				Magn.
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dish on which such meats are served</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archestr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				23.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Juv.
				3.142
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.74
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραψ-</span>codd., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>). (The second use is condemned by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				153
			</span></i>.)</div>
